  "text": "## Project: Nikah.com — Matrimonial Advertising & Profile Sharing Website\nCase study page (share this): https://bineeshs.vercel.app/project?slug=nikah-com\nLive website (share only if asked to see it): https://www.nikahcom.in/\nSource repository: https://github.com/happyweddingofficial/community-connect-hub\nTechnologies: React, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, SEO, WhatsApp Integration\nSummary: A clean, trust-focused website for a matrimonial advertising and profile-sharing service in Kerala, with a transparent four-step process, clear policy pages, testimonials, an FAQ and WhatsApp-first contact.\nQuick facts: Category: Matrimonial Advertising Website; Region: Malappuram · Kerala; Contact: WhatsApp-first; Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite\nCase study details: Nikah.com: Connecting Families with Respect, Privacy & Trust Nikah.com is a matrimonial advertising and profile-sharing service based in Malappuram, Kerala. I built its website to feel minimal, trustworthy and community-focused: a predominantly white, mobile-friendly design that families of every age group can read and act on without friction. The Goal The service is not a broker or matchmaking bureau, and the site had to say so clearly. Visitors needed to understand how profiles are received, prepared and shared, what the service does and does not do, and how to reach the team, all without feeling like they were using a complicated portal. What I Built - Home page with a clear value proposition, a visible \"not a broker\" notice and highlights on privacy, direct family connection and genuine enquiries. - Four-step \"How Our Service Works\" flow: profile submission, review and preparation, promotion and sharing, and direct family connection. - Principles and advertising policy sections covering independent verification, no outcome guarantees and how subscription fees work. - Testimonials and FAQ sections that answer common questions about the service, verification, subscriptions and profile removal. - WhatsApp-first contact: join and enquiry buttons throughout the site open WhatsApp with a pre-filled message. - Dedicated pages: About Us, Terms & Policy, Privacy Policy and Contact Us, with a footer linking to profile removal requests and social channels. SEO & Discoverability The site ships with canonical URLs, Open Graph and Twitter metadata, geo tags for Malappuram, Kerala and keyword-focused descriptions for local matrimonial searches. The aim: a respectful, transparent site that explains the service honestly and makes the next step a single tap away. Tech Stack - React with TypeScript, built and bundled with Vite - Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui-style reusable components - Optimised WebP images and responsive layouts - Deployed on Vercel",
